an><span begin="1:09.125" end="1:09.321">动</span><span begin="1:09.321" end="1:09.835">作</span><span begin="1:09.835" end="1:10.287">绽</span><span begin="1:10.287" end="1:11.213">放</span></p><p begin="1:11.386" end="1:14.248" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:11.386" end="1:11.854">明天</span><span begin="1:11.854" end="1:12.229">也</span><span begin="1:12.229" end="1:12.452">许</span><span begin="1:12.452" end="1:12.598">还</span><span begin="1:12.598" end="1:12.947">是</span><span begin="1:12.947" end="1:13.240">一</span><span begin="1:13.240" end="1:14.248">样</span></p><p begin="1:14.482" end="1:19.185" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:14.482" end="1:14.928">一样</span><span begin="1:14.928" end="1:16.166">就很好</span><span begin="1:16.166" end="1:16.537">了</span> <span begin="1:16.537" end="1:17.644">没什麼</span><span begin="1:17.644" end="1:17.915">奢</span><span begin="1:17.915" end="1:19.185">望</span></p><p begin="1:19.354" end="1:24.390" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:19.354" end="1:19.661">有</span><span begin="1:19.661" end="1:20.642">你的地</span><span begin="1:20.642" end="1:21.200">方</span><span begin="1:21.200" end="1:22.198">便是吾</span><span begin="1:22.198" end="1:24.390">乡</span></p></div><div begin="1:35.525" end="1:47.866" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="1:35.525" end="1:36.602" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:35.525" end="1:36.199">曾经以</span><span begin="1:36.199" end="1:36.602">为</span></p><p begin="1:36.612" end="1:40.351" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:36.612" end="1:36.976">知</span><span begin="1:36.976" end="1:37.122">足</span><span begin="1:37.122" end="1:37.764">常乐不</span><span begin="1:37.764" end="1:38.144">过</span><span begin="1:38.144" end="1:38.350">是</span><span begin="1:38.350" end="1:39.161">种自</span><span begin="1:39.161" end="1:39.341">我</span><span begin="1:39.341" end="1:39.749">体</span><span begin="1:39.749" end="1:40.351">谅</span></p><p begin="1:40.628" end="1:43.561" it